---
description: Explain what the actual terminal, native check and handoff receipts establish about the user's project.
args:
  goal: string
  opening: TerminalStart
  progress: TerminalProgress
returns: TerminalSummary
---
State the result in one or two sentences. Use observed for a read-only inspection, ready when the requested steps were completed, and held when a genuine failed, unavailable or incomplete prerequisite or requested hold prevents completion. Explain the relevant evidence and any in-scope response. Mention a clean exit, an interruption, changed viewport, or durable recovery only when supported by the actual events. A successful local handoff says what was verified without claiming a publication.
